{"id":"vod_sn_39228","vodId":"39228","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"白猫Project ZERO CHRONICLE","name_cn":"白猫Project ZERO CHRONICLE","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/7d4665f822328ea52d1df0fab3b0c3ef.jpg"},"summary":"很久很久以前，位于天空的白之王国和位于地上的黑之王国，一边保持着〈均衡〉一边进行着〈循环〉。但在某一时刻，强大的暗之王出现了。暗之王在侵略白之王国的同时，为了讨伐眼中钉巴尔而提议结下盟约。光之王艾莉丝，相信了使者阿德尔所说的盼望〈均衡〉的言语而结盟。即使在遭到阿德尔袭击之后，艾莉丝仍然相信斩杀了阿德尔的暗之王子，并立下一同为世界带来和平的〈约定〉。但两人的〈约定〉却遭到暗之王的践踏。不只是白，就连黑也企图毁灭的暗之王。发觉这一点的暗之王子，在地底发出哀叹之后，得到了飞越天空的力量，前往艾莉丝所在之处。暗之王子在镇压暗之军势，向艾莉丝伸出手的同时，一个世界宣告了终结……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0FpT1P7XsV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PuFj6qAJYU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GRVdiTcHbe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p41z4F2Zws1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ij9dgbEfUd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8Zfa06SQNm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kCcvVNUrj81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6UqyHmksey1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/x62BbQxZkt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ny1JLAy1nf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/N25Hq7uEew1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fMgfYU26Wj1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:48.724Z"}